{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>歌手吳業坤今日（22日）到斧山道運動場，為好友JW（王灝兒）老公、王至尊旗下的足球隊「至尊沙田」的港超聯比賽擔任表演嘉賓，他唱了兩首歌《原來她不夠愛我》和《原始心態》，觀眾席上更有不少粉絲舉牌撐場，由於「至尊沙田」開賽後已落後0比3，所以他就發揮搞笑本色，表示不會唱「one two three four」的數字歌曲，避免尷尬！</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-22T09:23:45.811877+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":172,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-22T08:21:23+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-22T13:37:12.152048+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-22T09:17:15.217659+00:00","content_hash":"c1ab841cadedcaf53f4076fc54c72811d23781d4741492bb7855defda3719e14","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-22T09:23:45.811877+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}